w/495489232_18383524561140506_7725140042948740919_n_caa66e78b9/w=640,h=426,f=jpeg,q=85 640w, https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/495489232_18383524561140506_7725140042948740919_n_caa66e78b9/w=676,h=450,f=jpeg,q=85 676w, https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/495489232_18383524561140506_7725140042948740919_n_caa66e78b9/w=768,h=512,f=jpeg,q=85 768w, https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/495489232_18383524561140506_7725140042948740919_n_caa66e78b9/w=1280,h=854,f=jpeg,q=85 1280w"></picture><div class="magazine-card__gradient" data-v-2c95e6e7></div><span class="magazine-card__badge" data-v-2c95e6e7>venues</span><div class="magazine-card__content" data-v-2c95e6e7><h3 class="magazine-card__title" data-v-2c95e6e7>Café del Mar Phuket voted #45 in DJ Mag Top 100 Clubs</h3></div><div class="magazine-card__shimmer" data-v-2c95e6e7></div></a><!--]--></div></div><div data-v-f9ea400f><a href="/articles" class="cta-button secondary" data-v-f9ea400f> Read Magazine </a></div></section><section class="content-section about-section" data-v-f9ea400f><div class="section-header" data-v-f9ea400f><h2 class="section-title" data-v-f9ea400f>About Cafe del Mar</h2></div><p class="description" data-v-f9ea400f>Café del Mar is a globally recognised music lifestyle brand, founded in Ibiza in 1980. Known for pioneering the chillout movement, its iconic Ibiza venue remains a symbol of the island’s most authentic sunset experience.

The brand has since evolved into an international presence, with a critically acclaimed music label and a growing portfolio of beach clubs around the world.</p><div data-v-f9ea400f><a href="/about" class="cta-button secondary" data-v-f9ea400f> Discover Our Story </a></div></section></div></div><!----><footer data-v-3086b9f1><div class="footer-logo" data-v-3086b9f1><!--[--><!--[--><img src="/logos/logo-vertical-light-stroked.svg" alt="cafe del mar brand logo" data-v-3086b9f1><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="social-icons" data-v-3086b9f1><a href="https://www.facebook.com/officialcafedelmar/" data-v-3086b9f1><!--[--><!--[--><img src="/socials/dark-facebook.svg" alt="facebook" data-v-3086b9f1><!--]--><!--]--></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/cafedelmar" data-v-3086b9f1><!--[--><!--[--><img src="/socials/dark-ig.svg" alt="instagram" data-v-3086b9f1><!--]--><!--]--></a><a href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/4L74W177Wc8s7WrQHbVaXt" data-v-3086b9f1><!--[--><!--[--><img src="/socials/dark-spotify.svg" alt="spotify" data-v-3086b9f1><!--]--><!--]--></a><a href="https://music.apple.com/gb/artist/caf%C3%A9-del-mar/264182083" data-v-3086b9f1><!--[--><!--[--><img src="/socials/dark-apple.svg" alt="apple" data-v-3086b9f1><!--]--><!--]--></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@cafedelmar" data-v-3086b9f1><!--[--><!--[--><img src="/socials/dark-youtube.svg" alt="youtube" data-v-3086b9f1><!--]--><!--]--></a><a href="https://www.deezer.com/us/artist/5374891" data-v-3086b9f1><!--[--><!--[--><img src="/socials/dark-deezer.svg" alt="deezer" data-v-3086b9f1><!--]--><!--]--></a></div><div class="newsletter" data-v-3086b9f1><a href="/account" class="cdm-account" data-v-3086b9f1><!--[--><!--[--><img src="/icons/cdmmag-dark.svg" class="cdm-account" width="25" alt="cafe del mar icon" data-v-3086b9f1><!--]--><!--]--><span class="sign-up" data-v-3086b9f1>Sign Up</span></a></div><div class="sitemap" data-v-3086b9f1><!--[--><div data-v-3086b9f1><span class="footer-section" data-v-3086b9f1>Ibi