6202",{"isrc":2446,"title":2447,"artist":1901,"artwork":2399,"preview_url":2448,"appleMusicId":2449},"US23A9388053","Can't Do It on My Own (Mixed)","https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/f0/44/bd/f044bdf9-b6e4-6b6a-4fba-0bfc080c40bc/mzaf_10658821757929957296.plus.aac.p.m4a","1832556203",{"isrc":2451,"title":2452,"artist":2453,"artwork":2399,"preview_url":2454,"appleMusicId":2455},"US23A9388054","Fallstar (Rising Mix) [Mixed]","Guy J","https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/e3/c1/45/e3c1454e-2df0-f78b-7939-fa2970eac632/mzaf_4544721213447932868.plus.aac.p.m4a","1832556204",{"isrc":2457,"title":2458,"artist":1901,"artwork":2399,"preview_url":2459,"appleMusicId":2460},"US23A9388055","Positive (Mixed)","https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/f7/bd/03/f7bd03f2-ebe7-8f55-8bd8-0bb333142f89/mzaf_71919377589610868.plus.aac.p.m4a","1832556505","Pig&Dan introduce Café del Mar’s new artist-curated Sundown mix series, reflecting their personal soundtrack to the setting sun - feautring new&exlusive Pig&Dan tracks Dreamer & Je Suis Perdu.","2025-08-29T07:24:27.679Z","2025-12-11T19:02:02.363Z","2025-08-29T07:24:34.592Z","https://soundcloud.com/cafedelmarmusic/cafe-del-mar-sundown-mix-vol1",{"data":2467},{"id":2468,"attributes":2469},233,{"name":2470,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":1668,"height":1668,"formats":2471,"hash":2496,"ext":22,"mime":25,"size":2497,"url":2498,"previewUrl":8,"provider":57,"provider_metadata":2499,"createdAt":2501,"updatedAt":2501},"sundownpigdan.png",{"large":2472,"small":2478,"medium":2484,"thumbnail":2490},{"ext":22,"url":2473,"hash":2474,"mime":25,"name":2475,"path":8,"size":2476,"width":28,"height":28,"provider_metadata":2477},"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/large_sundownpigdan_0e0b59a6e0/public","large_sundownpigdan_0e0b59a6e0","large_sundownpigdan.png",758.18,{"public_id":2474,"resource_type":2474},{"ext":22,"url":2479,"hash":2480,"mime":25,"name":2481,"path":8,"size":2482,"width":36,"height":36,"provider_metadata":2483},"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/small_sundownpigdan_0e0b59a6e0/public","small_sundownpigdan_0e0b59a6e0","small_sundownpigdan.png",197.81,{"public_id":2480,"resource_type":2480},{"ext":22,"url":2485,"hash":2486,"mime":25,"name":2487,"path":8,"size":2488,"width":44,"height":44,"provider_metadata":2489},"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/medium_sundownpigdan_0e0b59a6e0/public","medium_sundownpigdan_0e0b59a6e0","medium_sundownpigdan.png",429.68,{"public_id":2486,"resource_type":2486},{"ext":22,"url":2491,"hash":2492,"mime":25,"name":2493,"path":8,"size":2494,"width":52,"height":52,"provider_metadata":2495},"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/thumbnail_sundownpigdan_0e0b59a6e0/public","thumbnail_sundownpigdan_0e0b59a6e0","thumbnail_sundownpigdan.png",27.21,{"public_id":2492,"resource_type":2492},"sundownpigdan_0e0b59a6e0",1715.52,"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/sundownpigdan_0e0b59a6e0/public",{"public_id":2496,"resource_type":2500},"optimized-sundownpigdan_0e0b59a6e0","2025-08-29T07:24:23.710Z",{"data":2503},{"id":6,"attributes":2504},{"name":1479,"createdAt":1480,"updatedAt":1481,"publishedAt":1482},{"id":2506,"spotify":8,"apple":2507,"deezer":8,"youtube":8,"mixcloud":8,"amazon":8,"soundcloud":8},80,"https://music.apple.com/gb/album/cafe-del-mar-sundown-mix-dj-mix/1832556193",{"data":2509},{"id":2510,"attributes":2511},26,{"name":1901,"bio":2512,"pressPhotos":2513,"createdAt":2514,"updatedAt":2515,"publishedAt":2516,"slug":2517,"image":2518,"socials":8},"Pig & Dan have been shaping forward-thinking, genre-blurring electronic music ever since a chance meeting on a flight to Spain in 1999. Dan Duncan, with his drum’n’bass background, and Igor “Pig” Tchkotoua, rooted in the underground scene, quickly found chemistry in the studio two years later.\n\nTheir debut on Sven Väth’s Cocoon Recordings in 2002 kicked off a prolific collaboration, but it was their 2005 breakthrough “Oh Yeah” that put them firmly on the map. The track not only solidified their bond with Cocoon but also highlighted their signature sound — dark, twisted breakdowns fused with high-energy club moments. Since then, they’ve released on Bedrock, Drumcode, Truesoul, Defected, and Crosstown Rebels, while also founding Submission and ELEVATE to support up-and-coming talent.\n\nAs DJs, Pig & Dan have played the world’s biggest stages, including Ultra Miami, Tomorrowland, and Awakenings. They’ve also held residencies at iconic clubs like Amnesia Ibiza, Fabric London, and Womb Tokyo, known for delivering intense, melodic sets that hit hard while staying emotionally resonant.\n\nTheir studio output goes well beyond peak-time techno. Across artist albums like Destination Unknown and its follow-up, they explore chill-out, downtempo, and dub-inspired sounds — blending trip-hop, ambient textures, and jazz elements to showcase a deeper, more reflective side of their artistry.","https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/tl62d0vb6grelu192jibs/AO5Xu09m7aFove9XUYeDFz8?rlkey=1lphl6z6nykfle2uqsqtwc7ic&st=je0a3wuc&dl=0","2025-05-13T07:58:36.834Z","2026-07-27T00:58:18.051Z","2025-05-13T07:58:37.899Z","pig-and-dan",{"data":2519},{"id":2520,"attributes":2521},106,{"name":323,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":2522,"height":325,"formats":2523,"hash":2547,"ext":328,"mime":87,"size":2548,"url":2549,"previewUrl":8,"provider":57,"provider_metadata":2550,"createdAt":2552,"updatedAt":2552},613,{"large":2524,"small":2530,"medium":2536,"thumbnail":2542},{"ext":328,"url":2525,"hash":2526,"mime":87,"name":331,"path":8,"size":2527,"width":28,"height":2528,"provider_metadata":2529},"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/large_public_2bc8838216/public","large_public_2bc8838216",100,1253,{"public_id":2526,"resource_type":2526},{"ext":328,"url":2531,"hash":2532,"mime":87,"name":337,"path":8,"size":2533,"width":36,"height":2534,"provider_metadata":2535},"h