:3300,"artist":3301},"Discopolis - A Hundred Birds Bestless Mix","Lifelike, Kris Menace",{"title":3303,"artist":3304},"The Sun Rising","Meora",{"title":3306,"artist":3307},"Lights On The Vibe - Remastered","The Solid Doctor",{"title":3309,"artist":1426},"WLM",{"title":3311,"artist":3312},"Sweet Lullaby - Natural Trance Mix","Deep Forest",{"title":3314,"artist":3315},"Shift Then Return","Kid Loops, Cool Breeze",{"title":3317,"artist":3318},"Soothe - Chicane's Cyanide Ride Dub","Furry Phreaks",{"title":3320,"artist":3321},"Tears For Yazd","The Amalgamation Of Soundz",{"title":3323,"artist":3324},"Spirit - Spiritual Dub","Last Magpie",{"title":3326,"artist":3327},"Hommage à Noir - Edit","Ralf Hildenbeutel",{"title":3329,"artist":3330},"Camino Del Sol - Todd Terje Remix","Antena, Todd Terje",{"title":3332,"artist":3333},"Kaotic Harmony","Derrick May",{"title":3335,"artist":3336},"Immaculate - Instrumental Version","U. Kay Hytz",{"title":3338,"artist":3339},"Stella - Moby's Spirit Mix Edit","Jam & Spoon",{"title":3341,"artist":3342},"Angelica","Joe Hume",{"title":1553,"artist":1076},{"title":3345,"artist":3346},"Albatross","Suns of Arqa, John Leckie","Celebrating 45 years of soundtracking sunsets in Ibiza, the 45th anniversary compilation brings together a carefully curated selection of chilled-out tracks that reflect the spirit of the original sunset bar. Known for its iconic sunset sessions, Café del Mar Ibiza has become a symbol of the chillout movement and Balearic music.\n\nThis special release blends classic favorites with fresh reinterpretations and exclusive mixes, capturing the relaxed vibe and emotional depth that have defined the brand since 1980. From ambient atmospheres and acoustic textures to cool electronica, the selection offers a chilled listening experience, perfect for unwinding, reminiscing, and simply watching the sun dive into the sea.\n\nWhether you’ve been visiting Café del Mar for decades or are just discovering it, this collection captures the essence of what makes Café del Mar more than just a place...","2025-04-15T22:28:49.035Z","2025-09-01T07:16:40.610Z","2025-04-15T22:30:29.352Z",{"data":3352},{"id":3353,"attributes":3354},104,{"name":3355,"alternativeText":449,"caption":449,"width":325,"height":325,"formats":3356,"hash":3381,"ext":328,"mime":87,"size":3382,"url":3383,"previewUrl":8,"provider":57,"provider_metadata":3384,"createdAt":3386,"updatedAt":3386},"45TH-WHITE.jpg",{"large":3357,"small":3363,"medium":3369,"thumbnail":3375},{"ext":328,"url":3358,"hash":3359,"mime":87,"name":3360,"path":8,"size":3361,"width":28,"height":28,"provider_metadata":3362},"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/large_45_TH_WHITE_jpg_46ad5bb1d5/public","large_45_TH_WHITE_jpg_46ad5bb1d5","large_45TH-WHITE.jpg",168.89,{"public_id":3359,"resource_type":3359},{"ext":328,"url":3364,"hash":3365,"mime":87,"name":3366,"path":8,"size":3367,"width":36,"height":36,"provider_metadata":3368},"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/small_45_TH_WHITE_jpg_46ad5bb1d5/public","small_45_TH_WHITE_jpg_46ad5bb1d5","small_45TH-WHITE.jpg",55.47,{"public_id":3365,"resource_type":3365},{"ext":328,"url":3370,"hash":3371,"mime":87,"name":3372,"path":8,"size":3373,"width":44,"height":44,"provider_metadata":3374},"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/medium_45_TH_WHITE_jpg_46ad5bb1d5/public","medium_45_TH_WHITE_jpg_46ad5bb1d5","medium_45TH-WHITE.jpg",113.79,{"public_id":3371,"resource_type":3371},{"ext":328,"url":3376,"hash":3377,"mime":87,"name":3378,"path":8,"size":3379,"width":52,"height":52,"provider_metadata":3380},"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/thumbnail_45_TH_WHITE_jpg_46ad5bb1d5/public","thumbnail_45_TH_WHITE_jpg_46ad5bb1d5","thumbnail_45TH-WHITE.jpg",6.51,{"public_id":3377,"resource_type":3377},"45_TH_WHITE_jpg_46ad5bb1d5",115.25,"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/45_TH_WHITE_jpg_46ad5bb1d5/public",{"public_id":3381,"resource_type":3385},"gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw-45_TH_WHITE_9a0