n entry fee. A minimum spend may apply depending on your reservation (not applicable to minors under 16).",{"id":1755,"question":7299,"answer":7300},"How long can I keep the table after arrival?","The table is yours for the duration of your stay.",{"id":1390,"question":7302,"answer":7303},"How do I cancel my booking?","Use the confirmation link provided at the time of booking—cancellations are allowed up to 48 hours before.",{"id":4750,"question":7305,"answer":7306},"Why can't I book during sunset?","To ensure availability, we only accept bookings before or after sunset in case of no-shows.",{"id":7308,"question":7309,"answer":7310},15,"How can I book for a large group?","For groups over 20, please contact us directly via contact page form.",{"id":7312,"question":7313,"answer":7314},16," Do you have a dress code?","No formal dress code, but shirtless, shoeless, or swimwear is not allowed inside the venue.",{"id":321,"question":7316,"answer":7317},"Are children welcome?","Yes, as long as they do not disturb other guests or staff",[7319,7492,7634],{"id":6,"name":7320,"pax":8,"url":8,"minSpend":8,"description":7321,"image":7322},"First & Second Row","Directly by the sea, the best view of the sunset. ",{"data":7323},[7324,7360,7396,7433,7468],{"id":1502,"attributes":7325},{"name":7326,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":7327,"height":7328,"formats":7329,"hash":7354,"ext":84,"mime":87,"size":7355,"url":7356,"previewUrl":8,"provider":57,"provider_metadata":7357,"createdAt":7359,"updatedAt":7359},"0R2A8609.jpg",5550,3700,{"large":7330,"small":7336,"medium":7342,"thumbnail":7348},{"ext":84,"url":7331,"hash":7332,"mime":87,"name":7333,"path":8,"size":7334,"width":28,"height":29,"provider_metadata":7335},"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/large_0_R2_A8609_8cf0eea427/public","large_0_R2_A8609_8cf0eea427","large_0R2A8609.jpg",152.71,{"public_id":7332,"resource_type":7332},{"ext":84,"url":7337,"hash":7338,"mime":87,"name":7339,"path":8,"size":7340,"width":36,"