97},"724993025_122114026203121547_8216750954467941363_n_afdacc80ca",259.17,"https://imagedelivery.net/gWm-cErGDmEnDn2Z5pH7Pw/724993025_122114026203121547_8216750954467941363_n_afdacc80ca/public",{"public_id":10201,"resource_type":10205},"optimized-724993025_122114026203121547_8216750954467941363_n_afdacc80ca","2026-07-26T23:34:40.746Z",{"data":10208},[],{"id":66,"attributes":10210},{"name":10211,"description":10212,"videoUrl":8,"about":10212,"slug":10213,"createdAt":10214,"updatedAt":10215,"publishedAt":10216,"heroVideoUrl":8,"availableDate":10217,"locale":6956,"image":10218,"type":10255,"address":10258,"essentials":10269,"hours":10298,"spotlight":10300,"faq":10301,"reservationArea":10302,"sectionImages":8,"weather":10303,"video":10308,"stories":10309,"gallery":10310,"localizations":10311},"Phuket","Discover the perfect oasis in Phuket at the carefully designed Café del Mar venue. Located in the Kamala district of Phuket, Café del Mar offers stunning surroundings, top-notch facilities, delicious food, and much more. Reenergize on comfortable loungers dotted around our chill-out pool and surrounded by beautiful palm trees with stunning views of the beach and sea.\n\nWe’re all about that mellow Ibiza atmosphere with a Phuket vibe, creating a strong sense of community through weekly gatherings and shared culinary experiences provided by some of the top chefs in the country. As Phuket’s best beach bar, Café del Mar is ideal for a relaxing lunch, impressive dinner, or private party.","phuket","2025-05-19T12:22:18.092Z","2025-08-01T21:52:20.840Z","2025-05-19T12:22:20.639Z","2025-05-20T22:00:00.000Z",{"data":10219},{"id":10220,"attributes":10221},207,{"name":10222,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":10223,"height":10224,"formats":10225,"hash":10249,"ext":84,"mime":87,"size":10250,"url":10251,"previewUrl":8,"provider":57,"provider_metadata":10252,"createdAt":10254,"updatedAt":10254},"68384ca8cfeedbf96630707c_Restaurant-2.jpg",1300,867,{"large":10226,"small":10232,"mediu